<title>USA: Natchitoches Par SD 9, La. won by Duncan Williams.</title>
<headline>Natchitoches Par SD 9, La. won by Duncan Williams.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duncan Williams said it won $10 million of Natchitoches Parish School District No. 9, La., general obligation school bonds Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.2270 percent.</p>
